{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24079","headline":"对琴酒 · 白居易","name":"对琴酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西窗明且暖，晚坐卷书帷。\n琴匣拂开後，酒瓶添满时。\n角尊白螺醆，玉轸黄金徽。\n未及弹与酌，相对已依依。\n泠泠秋泉韵，贮在龙凤池。\n油油春云心，一桮可致之。\n自古有琴酒，得此味者稀。\n祗因康与籍，及我三心知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24079.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24079","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}